# Writing key 19 (mode) directly, 2026-07-27.
#
# The lamp was in music mode. We wrote all_white (00 00 05), then wrote
# music (02 00 07) back. Both writes were acknowledged at the ATT layer,
# both produced a change-push notification, and both read back from the
# state map.
#
# BUT NOTHING VISIBLE HAPPENED. Martin was watching and the lamp did not
# go white. So key 19 stores and reports a mode without repainting the
# lamp, the same trap key 8 set earlier: acknowledgement is not proof of
# effect. Only visual confirmation counts for this device.
notify_after_white: a2 18 54 1b 00 00 01 9f a6 cb 89 5f 13 43 00 00 05
notify_after_music: a2 18 54 1b 00 00 01 9f a6 cb 9f b9 13 43 02 00 07
